# PM-017 — Terraform Bootstrap Identity with `AdministratorAccess`

> **Security Postmortem · AWS IAM · Terraform Platform Rebuild**

A long-lived Terraform bootstrap credential was found with unrestricted administrator access to the AWS account. No compromise was identified, but the configuration created a full-account takeover path if the credential were ever exposed.

